Type: Package
Package: medley
Title: Predictive Modeling with Missing Data
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-10-29
Authors@R: 
    person("Jason", "Bryer", , "jason@bryer.org", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2454-0402"))
Description: Routines to estimate prediction models when there are
    systematic patterns to missing data. Utility functions are provided to
    explore the patterns of missingness and to help determine the set of
    models used for training and predicting. A method for estimating
    stratified models to address data where there is significant imbalance
    in the outcome variable.
    <https://medley.bryer.org/articles/medley.html>.
